id black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Reason</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Remark</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Created and adhered to customer callbacks /Acknowledgement call/customer call not done within 1 hrs of allocation of case</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Scored</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Scorable</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Reason Type</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Reason</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Remark</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Sent interim Social Post/ NCH portal response / SMS and Email sent for non contact</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Scored</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Scorable</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Reason Type</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Reason</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Remark</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>First public response/NCH holding response not sent within 30 mins of allocation of case</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Scored</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Scorable</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Reason Type</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE